        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International HK-5812, Oval Base Coat and Hat Hook</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLooking for a place to hang your hat? The Oval Base Two-Prong Hook can do that. It is easy to install and looks great even when its not holding your favorite hat, coat, or purse. Put a few in the bathroom for towels or screw in some by the stove for easy access to pot holders. Available in 7 finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 4-3/8 Inch Oval Base Coat and Hat Hook:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with matching finish screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/oil-bronze-crab.jpg?v=1704354545\" width=\"586\" height=\"116\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
